# Target interpreter for the anti-uav package.
#
# NOTE: this project deliberately does NOT create its own virtualenv. It reuses
# an existing conda environment (see docs/COMMANDS.md -> "0. Environment").
#
# 3.11 is the floor and 3.12 is fine. 3.13 WAS excluded here because lapx and
# opencv-python shipped no 3.13 wheels at the time - the last cp312-only lapx
# release was 0.5.13, and opencv needed >=4.10 for a cp37-abi3 build. That is no
# longer true:
#
#   lapx 0.10.0            cp313 manylinux_2_24_x86_64 wheels exist
#   opencv-python-headless cp37-abi3, so compatible with any CPython >= 3.7
#   ultralytics 8.4.x      3.13 supported
#
# Kaggle's current image ships 3.13, so the exclusion was blocking a working
# environment for no reason. Upper bound stays at 3.14 - untested here, and most
# pinned deps publish wheels a release or two behind.
3.11